{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40498","headline":"碧角簟 · 曹松","name":"碧角簟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"细皮重叠织霜纹，滑腻铺牀胜锦茵。\n八尺碧天无点翳，一方青玉绝纤尘。\n蝇行只恐烟黏足，客卧混疑水浸身。\n五月不教炎气入，满堂秋色冷龙鳞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹松","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40498.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40498","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}